# Private corpus + derivatives (per RL-loop spec §13)
# Note: git treats `~` as a literal char, not home-dir expansion.
# `**/.human/private/` matches the per-user corpus wherever it appears
# inside the working tree.
.human/private/
**/.human/private/

# Phase 1 (RL SOTA) — Gemma GGUF and other large model files. The
# fetcher script writes to ~/.human/models/, but contributors who
# fetch from inside the repo for testing should never accidentally
# commit a 4 GB GGUF.
.human/models/
**/.human/models/
*.gguf
